tent_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["36氪", "Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n文 | 李炤锋 王欣逸\n\n\n编辑 | 张雨忻\n\n在深圳，林舟所在的AI创业公司只有十个人，大部分工作都靠 AI", "published_at": "2026-09-20T11:11:30Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-20T11:12:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-3c0975a3294d.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-4d2b0abcdd8d", "title": "GTA 6 Has Kept All of Rockstar’s Promises So Far", "source": "VICE", "author": "Brent Koepp", "url": "https://www.vice.com/en/article/gta-6-rockstar-promises-ambitious-features/", "image_url": "https://www.vice.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/gta-6-jason-and-lucia-bank.jpg?w=150&h=150&crop=1", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gossip", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "VICE", "en", "gossip", "text", "游戏"], "excerpt": "\nSince its announcement, GTA 6 has been surrounded by concerns that Rockstar Games would eventually scale back some of its most ambitious features. However,", "published_at": "2026-09-19T16:57:12Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-20T11:12:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-4d2b0abcdd8d.json", "engagement": 110, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-5eb72f32379f", "title": "苹果最强芯片 M8 Ultra，能让 Mac 重回服务器市场吗？", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "彭海星", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1681050?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/6c8d33b7-6872-4e72-b7b8-fd5458901a54.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n先来一则趣闻：\n\n\n就在 iPhone Duo 发布之际，三星从新西兰找来了一个叫 Tim Cook 的普通居民，来为自家的折叠屏 Galaxy Z Fold 8 站台：\n\n且不说这次「碰瓷式」营销效果如何，至少可以看出，自家领地被苹果「入侵」，足以让很多友商产生应激反应。\n\n\n而现在，该轮到戴尔、HPE", "published_at": "2026-09-20T06:23:27Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-20T11:12:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-5eb72f32379f.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-6b6dc544cf35", "title": "世界杯进入早场谁接住了清晨的餐饮订单？百威早点铺为百威无醇和店家找到了新的生意机会", "source": "36氪", "author": "", "url": "https://36kr.com/p/3991595471895300?f=rss", "image_url": null, "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["36氪", "Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "足球"], "excerpt": "2026年美加墨世界杯共有104场赛事，换算成北京时间，半数以上比赛集中在清晨5点‑12点。对于国内上班族来说，观赛时间撞上睡眠、早餐与通勤，过去围绕深夜看球形成的消费模式，也随之发生改变。\n\n消费数据已经体现出消费时段的转移。来自京东外卖的监测显示，世界杯期间凌晨4‑5点早餐订单较赛前上涨约60%，5‑6点订单增幅接", "published_at": "2026-09-20T11:11:30Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-20T11:12:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-6b6dc544cf35.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-6f8a029b9bae", "title": "机器人如何自进化，乐享科技走了一条新路", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370665", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/85/ee/85ee4f1d1825ca3252671c9912d9a068.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "极客公园", "科技"], "excerpt": "作者｜Li Yuan\n\n\n编辑｜郑玄\n\n最近，乐享科技因为一个颇大胆的", "published_at": "2026-09-20T07:15:14Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-20T11:12:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-6f8a029b9bae.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-8385f00260f2", "title": "专访苹果高管，揭秘 iPhone Duo 幕后工程和设计哲学 副本", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "柯铭源", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1680763?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/img_6aad17dd72686.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n从 2019 年 2 月三星发布第一代 Galaxy Fold 算起，折叠屏手机已经走过七年半。\n\n\n7 年足够一个新品类从惊艳变成日常，但却依然没能把它熬成一个大众市场，折叠屏上那些无法忽视的痛点也没有随着时间消失。\n\n\n直到苹果带着 iPhone Duo", "published_at": "2026-09-19T16:00:45Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-20T11:12:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-8385f00260f2.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-9794416eead0", "title": "Meta 个人助手登顶美国 App Store；张雪机车发 5 款新车，最贵 13.8 万；淘宝闪购「制服」获法国设计最高奖，马云深度参与", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370615", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/a5/37/a53798f6b0e1e6993951ea0b91e042e1.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "极客公园", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n传 Anthropic 计划在 IPO 前夕推出新一代 AI 模型助力资本市场信心\n\n\n据路透社援引多名知情人士消息透露，全球顶尖人工智能初创企业 Anthropic 正考虑在公开首次募股（IPO）之前，正式发布其最新的旗舰级人工智能模型。这一战略举措旨在进一步巩固其在生成式 AI", "published_at": "2026-09-20T00:36:42Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-20T11:12:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-9794416eead0.json", "engagement": 200, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-a2039cf2e185", "title": "不可逆的人类衰老，快被 AI 破解了", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370664", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/31/dd/31dd9fcffd85dfd12ea1b24a58d97df3.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "极客公园", "科技"], "excerpt": "作者｜Li Yuan\n\n编辑｜郑玄\n\n2026 年 9 月，42 个平均 67 岁的人，在六只不同的时钟上同时变年轻了。\n\n\n这些时钟不在墙上，而在他们的血液里。\n\n\n服用一种名叫 rentosertib 的药物四周后，患者体内近 3000 种蛋白被检测，其中 326", "published_at": "2026-09-20T07:08:22Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-20T11:12:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-a2039cf2e185.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-aa16c97aa990", "title": "iPhone 18 Pro 系列开卖了，但苹果没告诉你的是……", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "郑廷旭", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1681102?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/img_6aafb42ae266b.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n首发购入 iPhone 18 Pro", "published_at": "2026-09-20T10:24:12Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-20T11:12:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-aa16c97aa990.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-ef8f2d6389be", "title": "Not all AI workers think the tech could kill everyone", "source": "BBC", "author": "", "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm5y7qj54klpo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image_url": "https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/cpsprodpb/ae2c/live/f246e690-b3a3-11f1-84e0-d100e0413eb5.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "News", "topic": "news", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["BBC", "News", "en", "news", "text", "科技"], "excerpt": "Not all employees of major firms working on artificial intelligence (AI) think the technology spells doom for humanity.\n\nIn text exchanges and conversations,", "published_at": "2026-09-19T23:01:57Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-20T11:12:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-ef8f2d6389be.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-efbf66d5c18c", "title": "Zelda Meets Assassin's Creed: Black Flag In Steam Game You Can Try Free Now", "source": "Screen Rant", "author": "Sharmila Ganguly", "url": "https://screenrant.com/zelda-assassins-creed-black-flag-draco-pirate-game/", "image_url": "https://static0.srcdn.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/link-looking-up-in-the-wind-waker.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "film", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "Screen Rant", "en", "film", "text", "游戏"], "excerpt": "Published Sep 20, 2026, 4:00 AM EDT\n\nSharmila is an engineer-turned-gaming hardware journalist and freelance contributor at ScreenRant who has been covering", "published_at": "2026-09-20T08:00:14Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-20T11:12:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-efbf66d5c18c.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-137c33bee089", "title": "闪迪暴涨11%，存储和芯片股“短期期权”爆巨量，“AI股神”又出手了？", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782123", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/f958da0e-7a69-4e7c-bdd6-cba53533c616.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n周五，约9600万美元短期看涨期权集中涌入闪迪（SanDisk）、美光（Micron）、英特尔（Intel）和Marvell四只AI芯片股。盘中，闪迪涨幅一度暴涨11%。\n\n\n看着这波“爆巨量”的短期期权交易流，CNBC主持人Jim", "published_at": "2026-09-19T03:27:00Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-19T11:32:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-137c33bee089.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-141de00ff7dd", "title": "iPhone 18 拿到手了吗？首选配件可以先安排上了", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "罗嘉阳", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1680982?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/img_6aae0589afced.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n一年一度的 iPhone 发布会来了，今年毫无疑问是个 iPhone 大年，除了折叠屏 iPhone Duo，直屏的 iPhone 18 Pro 也是有史以来性能释放最强的一代。\n\n一块 2nm 芯片，一套越来越强的相机系统，一座更小的灵动岛，再加上今年的新配色勃艮第红。苹果折腾一年，把这些变化装进了 iPhone", "published_at": "2026-09-19T04:00:24Z", "curate